msgid ":ref:`RC7_MIN <RC7_MIN>`: tail servo's lowest PWM value before binding occurs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/archived-tricopter.rst:26
#: f05e4c50158f4cc5a480c89406a47f40
msgid ":ref:`RC7_MAX <RC7_MAX>`: tail servo's highest PWM value before binding occurs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/archived-tricopter.rst:27
#: 0f02c89388c144ae81e5cc9e31ddb398
msgid ":ref:`RC7_MIN <RC7_TRIM>`: tail servo's PWM value close to what is required to keep the tail from spinning."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/archived-tricopter.rst:28
